{title: Until I Come}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
1. Until I come, will you remember
Through the bread, and through the wine.
Until I come, will you remember
That I love you, and you are mine.

Verse 2
2. Until I come, break bread together,
And drink the wine in one accord.
I am the Vine, and you're the branches.
You are my brethren, and I your Lord.

Verse 3
3. Until I come, will you remember
The battle's o'er, the vict'ry won.
Go tell the world I have arisen,
And I am with you, e'en before I come!

Verse 4
4. Until I come, will you remember
Through the bread, and through the wine.
Until I come, will you remember
That I love you, and you are Mine.
Yes, I love you ... for you are Mine!
